<title>USA: Cellstar Corp Q3 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Cellstar Corp Q3 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLLTON, Texas 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.64   profit	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net loss		  12,331   profit	 6,222</p>
<p> Revs		     223,590		  198,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,274		   18,895</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.76   profit	 $0.89</p>
<p> Net loss		  14,646   profit	16,528</p>
<p> Revs		     654,136		  566,949</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  19,274		   18,673</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q3 results include losses incurred in the company's South American operations, including a continued deterioration in its trade accounts receivable, an increase in the provision for inventory obsolescence and a related $2 million write-off of a deferred tax asset.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
